<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>旅拍婚纱照大PK</title>
<script type="text/javascript" id="MathJax-script" async
  src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js"></script>
<style>
  * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  body {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: "Microsoft YaHei", "PingFang SC", sans-serif;
    background: #fff;
  }
  .page {
    width: 540px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }
  .title-bar {
    text-align: center;
    padding: 22px 10px 14px 10px;
    background: #fff;
  }
  .title-bar h1 {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 30px;
    font-weight: 900;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
    color: #111;
  }
  .subheader {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    padding: 6px 22px 10px 22px;
    background: #fff;
  }
  .subheader .place {
    font-size: 15px;
    font-weight: bold;
    color: #222;
  }
  .subheader .vs {
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: bold;
    color: #333;
    background: #f0f0f0;
    border-radius: 50%;
    width: 26px;
    height: 26px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }
  .columns {
    display: flex;
    width: 100%;
  }
  .col-left {
    flex: 1;
    background: #cfe6ea;
    padding: 10px 8px 20px 12px;
  }
  .col-right {
    flex: 1;
    background: #e6f2f2;
    padding: 10px 12px 20px 8px;
  }
  .grid-2 {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 4px;
    margin-bottom: 4px;
  }
  .placeholder {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100px;
    background: repeating-linear-gradient(45deg, #dfe9ea, #dfe9ea 6px, #cfd9da 6px, #cfd9da 12px);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-size: 9px;
    color: #555;
    text-align: center;
    overflow: hidden;
    border: 1px solid #b9c9ca;
  }
  .placeholder.wide {
    height: 130px;
    grid-column: span 2;
  }
  .placeholder.tall {
    height: 205px;
  }
  .text-block {
    margin-top: 14px;
    font-size: 11.5px;
    line-height: 1.9;
    color: #333;
    text-indent: 1.5em;
    text-align: justify;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="page">

  <div class="title-bar">
    <h1>“旅拍婚纱照大PK”</h1>
  </div>

  <div class="subheader">
    <span class="place">新疆·喀什旅拍</span>
    <span class="vs">VS</span>
    <span class="place">新疆·伊犁旅拍</span>
  </div>

  <div class="columns">
    <!-- LEFT COLUMN: 喀什旅拍 -->
    <div class="col-left">
      <div class="grid-2">
        <div class="placeholder">[Photo: 新郎新娘与哈萨克族孩子草原合影]</div>
        <div class="placeholder">[Photo: 新人与儿童在草原奔跑]</div>
      </div>
      <div class="grid-2">
        <div class="placeholder tall">[Photo: 新娘头戴花环特写]</div>
        <div class="placeholder tall">[Photo: 新娘牵孩子雪山前留影]</div>
      </div>
      <div class="grid-2">
        <div class="placeholder wide">[Photo: 新人在雪山草原奔跑]</div>
      </div>

      <div class="text-block">
        在这片色彩浓郁的土地，增添了文化和艺术的极致体现满满的西部风格出片效果太绝了！如果你想要不一样的婚纱旅拍，这里一定是首要之选！
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- RIGHT COLUMN: 伊犁旅拍 -->
    <div class="col-right">
      <div class="grid-2">
        <div class="placeholder tall">[Photo: 新娘草坡远景牵手行走]</div>
        <div class="placeholder tall">[Photo: 新人脸部特写相拥]</div>
      </div>
      <div class="grid-2">
        <div class="placeholder">[Photo: 新娘戴礼帽草地特写]</div>
        <div class="placeholder">[Photo: 新人山坡漫步远景]</div>
      </div>
      <div class="grid-2">
        <div class="placeholder wide">[Photo: 森林小径夜色下的新人剪影]</div>
      </div>

      <div class="text-block">
        阳光和草原的风景像儿时梦里的画面一般梦幻，阳光下吹过的风，晚间夕阳落在芳草地上，都不及情到浓时两人相视一笑的那一抹温柔。
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

</div>
</body>
</html>
```
